<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Retribution Paladin Phase 4</h3>You should only ever run Tier shoulders in P4.  These are just too well statted and are going to be used well into P4.  No other shoulders come close to these.  Items listed as a P4 option that aren't tier, should only be considered when you have &lt; 264s tier items in those slots.<br/>
