<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Retribution Paladin Phase 4</h3>For feet you have your BIS items being armorpen items, the leather and plate boots are within about 5 dps of eachother, and then the mail option.  These two armor pen items have a lot of competition for them, especially the leather having rogues, ferals and hunters all after them, while plate boots have warriors and all dks.  For these you should just try to grab what ever you can and move along, though the mail piece will also have a great upgrade path when Ruby Sanctum comes out and we get the 284 hit /<wbr/> crit plate boots.   <br/>
