<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons  for Retribution Paladin Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-hand-weapons-for-retribution-paladin-phase-4">Two Hand Weapons for Retribution Paladin Phase 4</h4>Obviously the goal here is to acquire <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49623/shadowmourne">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_113.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowmourne</span></a>.  We suspect the proc rate is going to make ret the best carrier of shadowmourne, so get ready to fight off the browns.  As a note, you will have to adjust your expertise on your gear if you end up with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50730/glorenzelg-high-blade-of-the-silver-hand">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_153.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glorenzelg, High-Blade of the Silver Hand</span></a>.  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50709/bryntroll-the-bone-arbiter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_120.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bryntroll, the Bone Arbiter</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50727/bloodfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_staff_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodfall</span></a> so you're pretty much able to run which ever you can get your hands on while you're waiting on your 284 weapon.<br/>
